                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "feafbeef-f9ec-3475-be32-1015222ca7b0",
                        "entry_id": "92267e57-3a3f-3692-9f66-f71a8eab82c7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. установившееся, обычно благоприятное, мнение о ком-либо, о чём-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a23d9c8-8236-46a8-9eaf-b0044d8f1e8a",
                                "sense_id": "feafbeef-f9ec-3475-be32-1015222ca7b0",
                                "text": "И она ради сохранения реноме была готова на убыток."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ae98dbd5-5d92-439d-972d-b90913276db3",
                        "source_entry_id": "92267e57-3a3f-3692-9f66-f71a8eab82c7",
                        "source_sense_id": "feafbeef-f9ec-3475-be32-1015222ca7b0",
                        "target_lang_word": "reputation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "reputation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfa70ec3-89a5-3958-ada3-4b3b1c6ec046",
                                        "entry_id": "677ba6cc-1d8a-37e7-87dd-a6752e847ae7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "What somebody or something is known for."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d30c9bc7-e4b7-4d66-bcdb-f4b79d6e9f40",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa70ec3-89a5-3958-ada3-4b3b1c6ec046",
                                                "text": "And Balaam (or as the trueth of the hebrewe hath Bileam) doth signifie the people of no reputation\n or the vayne people or they that are not counted for people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37799a24-5d7b-408f-8f43-6da3c8600868",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa70ec3-89a5-3958-ada3-4b3b1c6ec046",
                                                "text": "Sometimes a man makes a reputation, deserved or otherwise, by a single action."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7e4e278-c361-4fc8-870b-7a14d2fc5bb0",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa70ec3-89a5-3958-ada3-4b3b1c6ec046",
                                                "text": "The reputations of our universities and our research base are already under threat because of the fallout from the EU referendum result, which is making the UK an unfriendlier place for overseas scholars and students, as well as cutting off access to an important stream of research funding and to a vibrant and well-developed ecosystem for collaborative work."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f086e92c-2211-4420-b962-5108a80a0959",
                        "source_entry_id": "92267e57-3a3f-3692-9f66-f71a8eab82c7",
